


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_4599b7e7:



    voice "FUM_0463"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_ebab6c36:


    "枕边的手机震动，文醒了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_93f7a3f2:


    "六点半。伦和阳菜都没有醒来的样子。只有文会为了做便当而早起。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_460d71fd:



    voice "FUM_0464"
    fumi "「好冷……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_eb26d888:


    "掀开被子，文感到一阵凉意。边抖了抖身子，边下了床。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_a5c57f3b:


    "穿上拖鞋，正准备像往常一样往厨房走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_2fbf8cd9:



    voice "FUM_0465"
    fumi "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_d5873f53:


    "发现脚边似乎掉了什么东西，弯下身捡了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_0284e0cf:



    voice "FUM_0466"
    fumi "「这个是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_7ec9dad6:


    "……那是。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_782fb3e6:



    voice "FUM_0467"
    fumi "「那到底是谁的羽毛呢？给，你的便当」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_f2b45038:



    voice "RIN_0513"
    rin "「嗯。谁的，不肯定是鸟的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_f22d0c24:



    voice "FUM_0468"
    fumi "「给你公交卡。天使……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_13bc5769:



    voice "RIN_0514"
    rin "「嗯。啊，你说那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_3bfda49c:



    voice "HIN_0633"
    hina "「但是这种羽毛挺少见的呢。至少既不是鸽子也不是乌鸦的羽毛」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_759991d1:



    voice "FUM_0469"
    fumi "「给你钱包。对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_b02c553f:



    voice "RIN_0515"
    rin "「嗯。是不是昨天那只火鸡身上的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_c47ebcc4:



    voice "HIN_0634"
    hina "「我们又没吃火鸡！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_2aeb4f2c:



    voice "FUM_0470"
    fumi "「最后，给你手帕。而且还是大片的白色羽毛」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_6ba953ac:



    voice "RIN_0516"
    rin "「谢谢。说来到底为什么这根羽毛会落在房间里？昨天晚上开着窗子睡觉的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_12bc1950:



    voice "FUM_0471"
    fumi "「我记得有好好关上的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_ced21d2f:



    voice "HIN_0635"
    hina "「羽毛这件事先不说，再不出门就得跑着去上课了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_cfd1c489:



    voice "FUM_0472"
    fumi "「啊，是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_fc8aa913:



    voice "RIN_0517"
    rin "「好嘞。在你们上课的时候我去调查一下这根羽毛吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_a3a1e8e1:



    voice "HIN_0636"
    hina "「不行！快出门去！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_2409675d:



    voice "RIN_0518"
    rin "「好吧好吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_278c7e29:


    "……………………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_comn_01_9a8d4d79:


    "桌子上的羽毛晃了起来。"
